  "2026-09-05T03:08:08.605Z","harness:codex",Context population summaries are computed before focus packing; returned_focus explicitly reports bounded selection counts. The omission receipt names the matching-items summary scope. Red then green fixture proves six open items remain six under limit one and orient/handoff.
  "2026-09-05T03:29:29.521Z","harness:codex","Mixed-status subtree acceptance passed: five matching items include three active, one closed, one canceled and one blocked despite limit=1. Calibration now measures 3468 tokens versus 3411 for two-item session orientation; 9624 versus 9780 for 2243 items. Large-workspace delivered identities change from 110 to 105 and suppressed repeats from eight to seven because gate work is held out of execution detail. Global 20000-token budget, complete cursor traversal, structural negative controls, and exact source coverage thresholds remain enforced."
  "2026-09-05T04:18:33.577Z","harness:codex","Separated complete matching-population context counters from bounded returned_focus counters and declared summary scope in omission receipts. Final local delivery evidence: pnpm quality:static passed; 8420 tests in 608 files passed with exact coverage statements 62214/62214, branches 47182/47182, functions 12920/12920, lines 59840/59840. Full typecheck, all six linked PM test runs, package-first dogfood (88 commands), temporary Node and Bun manual workflows, packed npm/npx/bunx consumers, compatibility migration, package artifact, docs/skills, SDK surface and contract checks passed. Refusal corpus closes 117/117 probes with negative controls; task-token corpus completes 8/8 tasks at 12667 estimated tokens. Tracker-context 41 assertions, graph-composition 10 assertions, and record-integrity pass. GitHub security inventories and pnpm audit are zero; fresh required Sentry/telemetry gate passes. PR review, merge, and publication remain separate subsequent claims."
  "2026-09-05T05:03:38.879Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1195 . Final corrected source passed the complete pnpm quality:static suite after structured defect evidence and all terminal closures, full typecheck, 8422 tests / 608 files at exact 100/100/100/100, 55 token surfaces, and temporary Node/Bun manual workflows. All original review findings have explicit reactions and responses; three valid edge cases have reproduced red/green regressions and the pre-publication closure objection was withdrawn. GitHub dependency/code/secret alerts are zero. This source will now receive a fresh hosted review/check round; publication remains separate."
  "2026-09-05T06:36:29.943Z","harness:codex","Final calibration clarification for PR 1195: the 2026-09-05T03:29:29Z comment preserves the intermediate 9624-token measurement before subsequent gate/container worklist output changes. The final executable scripts/release/context-intent-calibration.json Tier 2 records 2243 items, five orientation commands, 9757 spent tokens of 20000, 10243 remaining, 109 seen items, eight suppressed repeats, and 39024 delivered bytes. The standalone next surface returns eight rows in 4185 bytes / 1047 estimated tokens. The two-item session remains 3468 tokens. Final local context evaluation and hosted CI 33948454675 pass against these measured values. Calibration is generated by executable CLI replay, not from PM comment text; preserve the older history event and do not replace the measured artifact with its intermediate value."
